+7.  Update transmission: `T *= (1.0 - hitOpacity)` [S2, unofficial].
+8.  Advance ray origin: `rayOrigin += (t + 1e-6) * rayDirection` [S2, unofficial].
+9.  Increment `bounces` by $1$.
 
